# Test-owned scratch directories created at the REPOSITORY ROOT by
# mkdtempSync(path.join(root, ".xxx-mutation-")) in tests/ts/*.test.ts.
# Every such test has a finally that removes its directory, but a killed
# process (timeout, CI cancel) never runs the finally, and none of these
# prefixes was ignored -- so an interrupted run left an unignored directory
# at the root where it could be swept into a commit. One pattern per shape
# rather than nine literal names, so a new mutation test is covered by
# default instead of having to remember this file.
.*-mutation-*/
.*-shapes-*/
